        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Electrochemotherapy with bleomycin—risk irradiation (strontium-90 plesiotherapy), of recurrence; many achieve complete photodynamic therapy, electrochemotherremission. apy with bleomycin, or curettage/diathermy.",
