          "printed_page": 1288,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Invasive tumors—require radical surgical response; risk of recurrence. excision and adjunctive external beam",
          "pdf_page": 1370,
          "printed_page": 1288,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Dogs (superficial tumors)—surgery alone radiotherapy (cats); dogs not as responsive to may be curative. radiotherapy.",
