          "printed_page": 1288,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Analgesics for pain control and antibiotics surgery and/or radiation therapy, 70% of for secondary bacterial infections as tumors recurred with a median survival time indicated. of 3–6 months.",
